{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If the object is visible, approach it. If grabbable, take it and process it. Move to destination.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Condition ID = IsAtDestination    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />\"",
